    "Manufacturers sending engineers to install or commission equipment they have sold",
    "Service companies carrying out maintenance, repairs and warranty work",
    "Project engineers and supervisors on overseas sites",
    "Technical trainers teaching a client's staff to use new equipment",
  ]}
